/**
 * Texts produced by the UI-free qa/ layer and the exporters (issue titles, contract violations,
 * reports, Jira text, comments inside generated files). qa/ and utils/ modules run under Node
 * tests and must not import locales/, so this dictionary is self-contained; locales/index.ts
 * keeps it in step with the interface language through setQaLanguage().
 * Call qt() when the text is produced, never at module top level.
 */

